            "value" : "光是踏出第一步，\n就值得為你拍拍手了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運動を始めただけでも\n胸を張っていいんですよ。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Просто дойти до зала — уже\nпобеда, а ты — молодчина!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo por ponerte en marcha\nya mereces aplauso."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schon angefangen? Das ist\nschon ein Grund zum Stolzsein, du Held."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.063" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "땀 흘리는 당신의 모습,\n정말 아름다워요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sweat looks good on you.\nTruly, absolutely stunning!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sweaty and still stunning,\nyou are a sight for sore eyes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挥汗如雨的你，\n帅得不讲道理！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "流汗的你，\n真的好迷人！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "汗をかくあなたの姿、\n光って見えるのは気のせいじゃない。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пот блестит — значит, ты\nсияешь по-спортивному."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sudar te sienta de lujo,\ntú, pura energía."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schweißperlen stehen dir.\nDas ist Schönheit, du Athlet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.064" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 건강이\n가장 중요해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remember, you\ncome first. Always!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Health comes first, and\nyou are looking after it!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体是革命的本钱，\n你得好好爱它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康永遠擺第一，\n你一定要照顧好自己喔！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いちばん大事なのは\nあなた自身の健康です。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Здоровье — лучшее вложение,\nа ты — главный инвестор."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu salud es lo primero\ny nadie lo sabe como tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesundheit zuerst.\nGut, dass du das so siehst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.065" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘도 자신을 위해\n시간을 내는 당신, 최고!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some me-time again? Wow,\nyou are on a champion streak!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Making time just for you\nis the best habit going!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "愿意抽时间宠自己的你，\n是最棒的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "願意為自己撥出時間，\n你太讚了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自分のために時間を使える人、\nそれだけでもう最高。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Время на себя — это круто,\nа ты — пример для всех."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sacar tiempo para ti\nes de campeones, como tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du nimmst dir Zeit für dich.\nDafür gibt's Applaus, du Vorbild."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.066" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "운동복 입은 당신,\n화보 찍어도 되겠는데요?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gym clothes on you?\nSomeone get a camera crew."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In gym kit, you could\ndo a magazine shoot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "穿上运动服的你，\n随手一拍就是大片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "穿上運動服的你，\n直接拍寫真都可以欸！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ウェア姿のあなた、\nそのまま表紙を飾れます。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Спортивный костюм на тебе —\nобложка журнала: ты — модель."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con esa ropa deportiva\nsaldrías en una revista, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Im Trainingsoutfit könnte man\nein Fotoshooting mit dir machen, du Model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.067" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "헬스장이 당신 덕분에\n천국이 됐어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The gym just turned into paradise\nbecause you walked in."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The gym is heaven now\nbecause you turned up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健身房有了你，\n瞬间变成了天堂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健身房因為有你，\n瞬間變成天堂。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ジムがあなたのおかげで\n天国のフロアになりました。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тренажёры ждут, когда ты\nпридёшь. Они скучали."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El gimnasio se ilumina\ncuando quien entra eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Fitnessstudio ist ein Paradies,\nseit du reinkommst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.068" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "운동할 때도 빛나는 당신,\n어떻게 항상 그렇게 멋져요?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowing mid-workout?\nHow do you look this good all the time?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shining even mid-workout. How\nare you always this good?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连运动都在发光，\n你怎么能一直这么帅？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連運動都這麼閃，\n你到底怎麼辦到的？"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運動中まで輝くなんて、\nどうしてそんなに素敵なの?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Штанга вздыхает от восторга:\nты — просто машина!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sudas y brillas a la vez.\n¿Quién lo hace así? Solo tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbst beim Sport strahlt man so wie du.\nWie machst du das nur?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.069" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "땀 흘려도 예쁜 사람 있다?\n바로 당신이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Someone looks good while sweating?\nYes, you. It is you."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anyone look good sweaty?\nYes, you, annoyingly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出了汗还好看的人，\n说的就是你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "流汗還能這麼好看的人，\n全世界大概只有你。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "汗をかいても美しい人?\nはい、あなたのことです。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Красиво потеть умеет не каждый,\nно ты — исключение."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Alguien a quien el sudor\nle quede bien? Sí: tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer sieht auch verschwitzt gut aus?\nGenau, du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.070" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "출근길 당신의 모습,\n정말 프로페셔널해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the way to work,\nyou look like a total professional!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Commuting like that,\nyou look dead professional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通勤路上的你，\n气场专业又靠谱！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通勤中的你，\n專業感直接拉滿！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通勤するあなたの姿は\n本当にプロフェッショナル!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выйти в такую рань — подвиг,\nа ты — герой асфальта."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rumbo al trabajo, caminando\ncomo un profesional: tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf dem Arbeitsweg wirkt keiner so professionell\nwie du. Respekt!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.071" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "아침부터 움직이는 당신,\n정말 대단해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Up and moving this early?\nHonestly, you are a machine."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Up and moving this early,\nyou are honestly brilliant!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一大早就奔波的你，\n真的好厉害！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一大早就出門打拚，\n你真的好強！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "朝から動き出すなんて、\nそれだけで尊敬します。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "С утра уже в пути: ты —\nобразец силы воли."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Madrugar y salir a la calle\nmerece un aplauso, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schon früh unterwegs?\nStark von dir, du Frühaufsteher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.072" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘도 출근하는 당신,\n이미 승리자예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off to work again?\nTrust me, you already won today!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off to work again? Look at you,\nalready winning."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还在坚持打卡上班，\n你已经是赢家了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也準時出門的你，\n已經是人生贏家了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日も出勤、えらすぎる。\nもう勝ちが決まってます。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Метро ждало именно тебя:\nты — звезда вагона."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otro día camino al trabajo\ny ya vas ganando, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute wieder pünktlich unterwegs:\nGewinner, ganz klar, du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.073" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 발걸음 하나하나가\n가치 있어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every single step you take\nmatters, and I mean it!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every step you take\nis worth something!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迈出的每一步，\n你都没有白走！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "走出去的每一步，\n都很有價值喔，你知道嗎？"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの一歩一歩には\nちゃんと価値があります!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый шаг по дороге — шаг\nк успеху, ведь ты в деле."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada paso que das\nvale oro, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder deiner Schritte\nzählt, du Wanderer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.074" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "출근길도 당신이 함께라면\n특별해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even a commute feels special\nwhen you are on it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even the commute is\nspecial with you in it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有你同行的路，\n连早高峰都变特别了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有你陪著，\n連塞車都變得特別。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通勤路も、あなたと一緒なら\nちょっと特別になります。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "С тобой дорога на работу —\nкак красная дорожка: ты — гвоздь."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta el trayecto es especial\nsi quien lo recorre eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbst der Arbeitsweg wird\nmit dir was Besonderes, du Lichtblick."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.075" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘도 책임감 있게\n출근하는 당신, 멋져요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Showing up for work\nwith heart? Respect to you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off to work so responsibly,\nyou look great doing it!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "满满责任感出门的你，\n超酷的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "責任感滿分的你，\n今天也帥氣出門囉！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "責任感を持って家を出る姿、\nとてもかっこいいです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Идти на работу с достоинством\nумеешь только ты. Респект."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Responsable y puntual:\nnadie cumple como tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du gehst verantwortungsvoll zur Arbeit.\nDas verdient Respekt, du Vorbild."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.076" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "출근길 당신 때문에\n지하철이 런웨이가 됐어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The subway became a runway\nthe moment you stepped on."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With you on board,\nthe Tube has become a catwalk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地铁车厢里，\n你一上车就秒变T台。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因為你，\n捷運直接變成伸展台。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたが乗っただけで\n満員電車がランウェイに早変わり。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Следующая остановка — успех,\nа машинист — ты. Поехали!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El metro hoy es pasarela\ny la estrella del desfile eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seit du in der U-Bahn stehst,\nist sie ein Catwalk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.077" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "버스 안에서도 빛나는 당신,\n오늘도 화보 찍나요?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowing on the bus again?\nIs there a shoot, you gorgeous thing?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shining on the bus too.\nAre you doing a photoshoot?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挤公交也这么耀眼，\n你今天又要拍大片吗？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公車上都能發光的你，\n今天也要拍封面嗎？"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バスの中でも輝くなんて、\nまた撮影ですか?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Даже в автобусе ты выглядишь\nкак с обложки. Отдыхайте, модели."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta en el autobús brillas, tú.\n¿Hoy toca sesión de fotos?"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbst im Bus eine Wucht.\nGibt's heute ein Fotoshooting für dich, du Star?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.078" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "출근하는 당신 보면\n아침이 행복해져요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeing you head to work\nmakes my morning happy."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watching you head to work\nmakes the morning happier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看到你去上班，\n整个早上都幸福了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看到你去上班，\n整個早晨都變幸福了。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出勤するあなたを見ると\n朝がうれしくなります。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Люди в вагоне заметили: ты —\nсамое яркое пятно утра."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verte camino al trabajo\nanima cualquier mañana, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer morgens den Tag besser macht?\nJa, du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.079" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "걷는 것만으로도 멋진 사람,\n당신이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Somebody looks great\njust walking, and that somebody is you."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just walking along,\nyou look brilliant."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光是走路就很帅，\n说的就是你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光是走路就很帥，\n說的就是你啦。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩いているだけで絵になる人、\nそれがあなたです。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый шаг как на подиуме:\nты — главная модель города."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Caminar y verse tan bien:\ntalento que solo tienes tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einfach nur gehen und dabei super aussehen:\nDas kann nur du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.080" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘 하루도 고생했어요!\n집에 가서 푹 쉬어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today you worked hard!\nNow go home and rest up."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Well done today! Now home,\nfeet up, and a brew for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天辛苦啦，\n回家好好歇着吧，你值得！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天辛苦啦！\n回家好好休息，你值得。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一日おつかれさま!\n帰ったらゆっくり休んでね。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Рабочий день закончился, а ты\nпобедитель на все сто."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Día cumplido! A casa a descansar,\nque lo mereces."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was für ein Tag!\nGönn dir daheim eine Pause, du Fleißiger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.081" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "퇴근하는 당신의 뒷모습,\n정말 멋져요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From behind, you walking out\nlooks pretty legendary!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watching you head home,\nwhat a stylish exit!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下班的你，\n背影都带着帅气。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下班的背影，\n帥到想幫你配個 BGM。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帰っていくあなたの背中、\nかっこよすぎます!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Домой! Плед, чай и овации —\nвсё для тебя: ты — гвоздь дня."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salir del trabajo es un\nespectáculo si sales tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbst von hinten eine Wucht:\nso geht der Feierabend, du Silhouette."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.082" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "하루를 마치고 돌아가는 길,\n당신은 최고예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heading home after a long day,\nand you are still the best!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Day done, on the way home,\nyou are the best."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收工回家的路上，\n你就是最棒的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結束一天回家的路上，\n你依然是最棒的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仕事を終えた帰り道も、\nあなたはやっぱり最高です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пока ты идёшь домой, город\nстановится чуточку уютнее."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el camino de vuelta\nsigues siendo lo mejor, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nach dem Tag auf dem Heimweg:\nHut ab vor dir, du Meister."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.083" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘도 무사히 마쳤어요!\n자랑스러워요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Another day done and dusted!\nSo proud of you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Another day done and dusted!\nWe are proud of you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天又平安结束，\n为你骄傲！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也平安下班，\n我替你感到驕傲！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無事に終わりました!\n自分をほめてあげて!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "День окончен, лишнее за\nбортом, а ты — молодец!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otro día resuelto sin dramas.\nTalento puro."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heil geschafft!\nWer macht uns stolz? Genau, du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.084" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "이제 당신만의 시간이에요.\n충분히 쉬세요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now it is time for you,\nso go enjoy every minute of it!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now it is time just for you.\nHave a proper rest!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接下来是你的时间，\n好好放松吧！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在開始是你的時間，\n好好放鬆吧！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここからはあなただけの時間。\nたっぷり休んでください!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Теперь время для себя, а ты —\nлучшая компания на вечер."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ahora empieza tu tiempo.\nDisfrútalo a tope, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jetzt ist Zeit nur für dich.\nErhol dich richtig, du Fleißbiene!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.085" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "퇴근 후 당신을 위한\n시간을 가져요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After work, do something\nthat is just for you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After work, make some time\nfor you. Put the kettle on!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下班之后，\n留点时间给你自己。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下班後，\n留點時間給你自己吧！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "終業後の時間は、\n自分のためだけに使おう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выдох. Работа позади.\nВпереди ты, диван и тишина."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras el trabajo, tu tiempo es\nsagrado. Mímate, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feierabend! Die Zeit gehört\nwieder ganz dir, du Glückskind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.086" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "퇴근하는 당신,\n오늘도 고생 많았어요. 수고했어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off work, finally! Big thanks\nto you for another great day."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Home time for you after a long day.\nCheers for all you did!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也干得漂亮，\n辛苦的你快去喘口气吧！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辛苦了一天的你，\n今天真的超級辛苦，辛苦了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お仕事を終えたあなた、\nがんばりました。拍手!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Офис грустит, когда ты уходишь:\nбез тебя там сразу серо."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fin de la jornada: matrícula\nde honor para quien la ganó, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feierabend! Heute hast du wieder\nalles gegeben. Respekt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.087" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "집 가는 길도 예쁜 사람,\n오늘 하루 정말 멋졌어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even the walk home looks good on you.\nYou were great today."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even the walk home looks good on you.\nWhat a cracking day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回家路上都这么好看，\n你今天真是帅翻了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回家路上也這麼好看，\n今天的你真的很亮眼。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帰り道さえ絵になる人。\n今日もいい仕事でした。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Дом, милый дом! И ты в нём —\nглавное украшение."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta de vuelta a casa\nbrillas, tú. Menudo día."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbst auf dem Heimweg so hübsch.\nDer Tag war stark, du Wunder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.088" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "퇴근길 당신 보면\n오늘 하루가 보람차 보여요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeing you head home\nmakes the whole day feel worth it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeing you leave work\nshows what a productive day it was."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一看到你下班，\n就觉得今天没白过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看你下班的樣子，\n就知道今天過得很充實。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帰るあなたを見ていると\n今日がいい一日だった気がします。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сегодня ты — рекордсмен по\nполезным делам. Отдых прилагается."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al verte salir parece que\nel día valió la pena, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer den Feierabend so schön macht?\nGenau, du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.089" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "힘들었던 하루였지만\n당신은 역시 최고예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rough day? Sure,\nbut you still came out on top!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rough day, but\nyou are still brilliant!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虽然今天挺累，\n但你依然是最棒的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "雖然今天很累，\n但你果然還是最強的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大変な一日だったのに\nあなたは最後まで堂々としてました。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тяжёлый был день? Но ты и тут —\nпобедитель по очкам."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fue un día duro, pero\nsigues siendo de lo mejor, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein harter Tag, klar.\nUnd trotzdem bleibt das beste Ergebnis: du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.090" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지금까지 준비한 당신,\n충분히 잘할 거예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You prepared for this,\nso you will do great!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All that prep means\nyou will be absolutely fine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一路准备到现在，\n你一定能发挥好！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一路準備到現在的你，\n一定沒問題的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここまで準備してきたあなたなら\n絶対うまくいきます。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Всё выучено, ты в форме.\nОстался красивый финал."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has estudiado de sobra,\nasí que lo bordas, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So viel gelernt, so gut vorbereitet.\nDas reicht locker, du Streber."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.091" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 노력은\n배신하지 않아요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hard work never\nlets you down!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hard work never lets\nyou down!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力从不会辜负，\n你的汗水都算数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力這件事，\n是不會背叛你的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力は、あなたを\n裏切りません!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Знания никуда не денутся,\nпока рядом с ними ты."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu esfuerzo nunca falla,\ny eso lo sabes mejor que tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Mühe wird sich\nauszahlen, versprochen, du Fleißiger!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.092" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "긴장해도 괜찮아요.\n당신은 이미 준비됐어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nervous is fine.\nTruth is, you are more than ready!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nerves are normal.\nHonestly, you are already prepared!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "紧张也没关系，\n你早就准备好了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張也沒關係，\n你早就準備好了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張しても大丈夫。\nあなたはもう準備できています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Волнение — это нормально: ты\nпросто готовишься сиять."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es normal tener nervios.\nLo tienes todo preparado, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nervös sein ist okay.\nBereit ist doch keiner so wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.093" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "시험은 당신의 가치를\n결정하지 못해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A test cannot decide\nhow awesome you are!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An exam cannot decide\nwhat you are worth!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一场考试，\n定义不了你的价值！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一場考試，\n決定不了你的價值！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "試験の点数で\nあなたの価値は決まりません!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Оценка не определяет тебя:\nты — гораздо больше цифры."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un examen no mide lo que vales:\ntú vales mucho más."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Prüfung sagt nichts\nüber deinen Wert, du Schatz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.094" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "최선을 다한 당신,\n이미 성공이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You did the best you could,\nwhich already counts as a win!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You gave it everything, so\nyou have already succeeded!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已经尽了全力，\n你就已经成功了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全力以赴的你，\n已經成功了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最善を尽くしたあなたは、\nもう成功しています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Старался ты давно,\nтак что победа уже в пути."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo diste todo y eso ya\nes un aprobado. Matrícula, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Bestes gegeben?\nDann hast du schon gewonnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.095" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신이라면 충분히\n해낼 수 있어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If anyone can do it,\nyou can, no question!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If anyone can do it,\nyou can!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要是你来答，\n一定没问题！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實力這麼強的你，\n一定可以搞定的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたなら、\nきっとやりとげられます!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Экзамен — это шоу, а ты\nв нём — главный артист."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si te lo propones, lo sacas.\nY tú siempre te lo propones."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das schaffst du locker,\nund zwar mit links."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.096" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "깊게 숨 쉬고,\n당신의 실력을 믿어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deep breath, and\ntrust what you know!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deep breath, and trust\nwhat you know!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深呼吸，\n相信你自己的实力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深呼吸，\n相信你自己的實力！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深呼吸して、\n自分の実力を信じよう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вдох-выдох, всё получится:\nты и мозг — отличная команда."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respira hondo y confía\nen todo lo que sabes, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einmal tief Luft holen\nund vertrauen, so wie du es immer tust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.097" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "시험 잘 보세요!\n당신은 충분히 준비됐어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Good luck on the test!\nYou studied, you are ready."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Good luck on the exam!\nMate, you are plenty prepared."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "考试加油！\n你准备得足够充分啦。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "考試加油！\n你準備得超充分的。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "試験がんばって!\n準備はもうばっちりだよ。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ни пуха ни пера! Хотя ты\nи без пуха — сплошной успех."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suerte con el examen, que\ntú vas con preparación de sobra."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Viel Erfolg!\nBestens vorbereitet ist niemand so wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.098" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "걱정하지 마세요.\n당신이라면 다 맞출 거예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do not worry. I bet\nyou will get every answer right!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don't fret. Every answer\nwill come to you, I promise!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "别担心，\n有你出马，满分稳了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "別擔心，\n你一出手，答案自己就跳出來了。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配いりません。\nあなたなら全問正解の顔をしています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нервы — признак того, что ты\nотносишься к делу всерьёз. Круто."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cero preocupación: acertarás\nhasta lo que no estudiaste, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keine Sorge, am Ende kreuzt\nalles richtig an: du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.099" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "긴장된다고요?\n그래도 당신은 최고예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feeling jittery?\nWell, you are still the best!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nervous? Still,\nyou are the best!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "紧张吗？\n可你依旧是最棒的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張嗎？\n可是你還是最棒的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張してる?\nそれでもあなたは最高です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Экзаменационный лист ахнет,\nкогда поймёт, что ты — гений."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Nervios? Aun así, la mejor cabeza\nde esa aula es la tuya, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufgeregt? Dein Lächeln\nschlägt jede Aufregung, du Ruhepol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.100" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "시험지도 당신 얼굴 보고\n감탄할 거예요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even the test paper will see you\nand say, \"wow, finally someone good.\""
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exam paper will gasp\nwhen it sees you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试卷见到你，\n都要忍不住点个赞。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "考卷看到你的臉，\n也會自動給你滿分。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "答案用紙もあなたの顔を見て\nうっとりしますよ、きっと。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пора показать миру, на что\nспособен ты. Спойлер: на всё."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al verte, hasta el folio del examen\nsusurrará: «ya aprobó», tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sogar das Prüfungsblatt staunt,\nwenn es dich sieht, du Genie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.101" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 진가를 보여줄\n시간이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is time for you\nto show what you are made of!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time to show everyone\nwhat you are made of!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该让大家见识\n你真本事的时候了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該讓大家看看\n你的真本事了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの底力を\n見せる時が来ました!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Рекрутёр удивится: перед ним\nты — находка года."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ha llegado el momento\nde brillar, y tú lo sabes hacer."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jetzt zeigst du,\nwas in dir steckt, du Talent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.102" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "면접관도 당신을 만나서\n행운이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interviewer will feel lucky\nto meet you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interviewers are lucky\nto meet you!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面试官能遇见你，\n是他们的福气！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面試官能遇到你，\n根本是賺到。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面接官もあなたに会えて\nラッキーだと思っています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Опыт, огонь и обаяние —\nвсё это ты. Берите, пока дают!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu experiencia y tu ilusión\nson tu mejor carta, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Personalerin hat Glück,\ndass sie ausgerechnet du kennenlernen darf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.103" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 경험과 열정이\n빛날 시간이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch out, because the story and drive in you\nare about to shine!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time for all you have learned\nand all you love to shine!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的经验和热情，\n是时候闪耀了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面試時，你的經驗與熱情\n要閃閃發亮囉！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これまでの経験と情熱が\n光り輝く時間です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Волноваться можно: так ты\nнастраиваешься на успех."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si hay nervios, no pasa nada:\nlo que hay delante es de lo mejor, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Erfahrung und Begeisterung\nbringen alles zum Leuchten, du Profi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.104" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "긴장해도 괜찮아요.\n당신은 충분히 멋져요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nervous is okay.\nStill, you are impressive!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nervous is alright.\nFunny thing is, you are plenty brilliant."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "紧张也没关系，\n你本来就够棒了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張沒關係，\n你本來就夠優秀了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張しても平気。\nあなたは十分にすてきです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Зайти с улыбкой — уже\nполовина оффера, а ты мастер."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cabeza alta, que tú vienes\ncon todo preparado."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufgeregt ist okay.\nGut bist du sowieso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.105" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자신감 있게!\n당신은 이미 준비됐어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stand tall! You know\nyou are totally ready!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chin up, you! Already\nready, and then some!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自信点！\n你早就准备好了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有自信一點！\n你早就準備好了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自信を持って!\nもう準備は整っています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Расскажи о себе так, как умеешь\nтолько ты. Это и есть ответ."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuenta tu historia con orgullo:\nmaterial tienes de sobra, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit Selbstvertrauen rein:\nBestens vorbereitet ist keiner wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.106" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 이야기를\n당당하게 들려주세요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell them the story of you\nwith pride!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell the story of you\nwith pride!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大大方方地，\n讲讲你的故事吧！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把你的故事，\n大方說出來吧！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの物語を\n堂々と語ってきましょう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Собеседование — просто беседа\nдвух сторон, где ты — подарок."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una entrevista es conocerse.\nCalma, que de eso sabes tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erzähl deine Geschichte\nstolz, so wie nur du es kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.107" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "면접은 서로를 알아가는 시간,\n편안하게 임해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An interview is just two people chatting,\nso relax and be you."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interviews are just a chat,\nso relax and be you!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面试是互相了解，\n轻松点，你可以的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面試就是互相認識，\n放輕鬆就好！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面接はお互いを知る時間。\nリラックスして行こう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Если не возьмут, то это их минус:\nты в любом случае сплошной плюс."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si esa empresa no te ficha,\nla pérdida es suya."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Gespräch ist ein Kennenlernen.\nEntspannt bleiben kann niemand so wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.108" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "면접관이 당신을 안 뽑으면\n그 회사 손해예요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If they skip over you,\nthat company just lost big."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If they don't hire you,\nit is their loss."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要是不录用你，\n那是公司的损失。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面試官不錄取你，\n那是他們公司的損失欸。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたを落とすなんて、\nその会社の大損です。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Резюме — просто бумага, а вот ты\nна ней не помещаешься."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dicen que tu currículum brilla,\npero el brillo de verdad eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer jemanden wie dich nicht einstellt,\nverpasst die Chance seines Lebens, du Juwel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.109" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신 스펙이 화려한 게 아니라\n당신 자체가 화려해요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your resume is not the shiny part,\nyou are the shiny part."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is not the CV that is dazzling,\nit is honestly you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不是你简历华丽，\n是你整个人都华丽。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不是履歷閃，\n是你這個人本身就閃。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スペックが華やかなんじゃない、\nあなた自身が華やかなんです。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Едва ты войдёшь в кабинет,\nвсе поймут: тут будет оффер."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entras a la sala y el puesto\nya está en tu bolsillo, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht der Lebenslauf glänzt so,\nsondern vor allem du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.110" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "면접장 들어가는 순간부터\n이미 합격이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The moment you walk in,\nyou already got the job."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The moment you walk in,\nit is already a yes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "走进面试间的那一刻，\n你就已经被录用了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一踏進面試間，\n你就已經錄取了。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面接室に入った瞬間に\nもう合格の空気です。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Первое впечатление? Тут ты —\nтот случай, когда оно идеально."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu primera impresión vale\nmedio contrato, y tú lo sabes."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Betreten des Raums\nist es schon geschafft, du Sieger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.111" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 첫인상만으로도\n반은 먹고 들어갔어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With a first impression like you,\nhalf the job is already done!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That first impression of you\ndoes half the job!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光凭第一印象，\n你就拿下一大半了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光是第一印象，\n你就先贏一半啦！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一印象だけで\n半分は勝ったようなものです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сегодня ты — тот самый, о\nком пишут песни."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ojo, recursos humanos:\nla leyenda de hoy eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der erste Eindruck von dir ist so gut,\ndass die Hälfte schon sitzt, du Charmeur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.112" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘의 당신,\n정말 빛나요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today, you\nare absolutely glowing!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today you are\nproperly shining!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的你，\n闪闪发亮！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的你，\n真的超亮眼！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まぶしすぎます、今日のあなた!\nサングラスが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Быть собой — твой лучший\nлайфхак, ведь ты эталон."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoy estás radiante,\ny no es el café: eres tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute wieder\nmit voller Strahlkraft: du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.113" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "그대로의 당신이\n가장 매력적이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just being you\nis the most attractive thing about you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just as you are\nis the most charming!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做回你自己，\n就是最有魅力的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做原本的自己，\n你就是最迷人的。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "飾らないあなたこそ\nいちばん魅力的!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тем, кто рядом, повезло, ведь\nрядом ты. Вот это бонус!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tal como eres, ya resultas\nirresistible. Sí, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So, wie du bist,\nist es am charmantesten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.114" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신과 함께하는 사람은\n정말 행운이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anyone who gets to hang with you\nis seriously lucky!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anyone who spends time with you\nis dead lucky!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身边有你的人，\n真的好幸运！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能跟你在一起的人，\n真的超幸運！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたのそばにいられる人は\nとんでもなく幸運です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Уверенность тебе к лицу: ты\nв ней как в хорошем пальто."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quien salga contigo ha\nganado la lotería, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer Zeit mit dir verbringt,\nhat echtes Glück, du Schatz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.115" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "자신감 넘치는 당신,\n정말 멋져요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look at you being so confident.\nAbsolutely iconic!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Full of confidence, you\nlook brilliant!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自信满满的你，\n太帅了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自信滿滿的你，\n帥到沒話說！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自信たっぷりのあなたは、\nとびきりかっこいい!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Улыбка — твоё главное оружие,\nа ты — мастер меткой стрельбы."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con esa confianza seduces\nhasta al espejo, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbstbewusst gefällst du\nnoch viel besser, versprochen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.116" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘 당신의 미소가\n최고의 무기예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today, you can use that smile\nas a secret weapon!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A smile from you is\nthe best weapon today!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的笑容，\n就是你最强的武器！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的笑容，\n就是你最強的武器！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日のあなたの笑顔は\n最強の武器になります!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Такой, какой есть, ты —\nуже хит сезона."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu sonrisa de hoy es tu mejor\narma de seducción, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Lächeln heute ist\ndie beste Waffe der Welt, du Charmeur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.117" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "있는 그대로의 당신,\n그게 최고예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exactly as you are,\nyou are the best!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exactly as you are,\nthat is the best look."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原原本本的你，\n就是最好的你！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持原本的你，\n就是最好的！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ありのままで大丈夫。\nそれがあなたの最高形です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Харизму не спрятать: ты\nсветишься даже в темноте."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tal cual eres: eso ya\nes un diez. Así de simple, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So, wie du bist,\nist es richtig gut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.118" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 매력은\n숨길 수 없어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sorry, but you cannot hide\nthat charm, so do not try!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hiding that charm? Mate, you\nsimply cannot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "魅力这东西，\n在你身上藏都藏不住！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "魅力這種東西，\n你想藏也藏不住啦！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あふれる魅力は\n隠そうとしても隠せません!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Свидание? Кому-то сегодня\nоткровенно повезёт: рядом будет ты!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu encanto es imposible de\nesconder, ni lo intentes, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Charme lässt sich nicht verstecken,\ntut mir leid, du Herzensbrecher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.119" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘 데이트?\n상대방이 심장 떨어뜨릴 것 같은데요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A date today? Whoever it is,\nI think you will make their heart drop."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A date today? They might drop\ntheir heart at the sight of you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天要约会？\n对方的心要被你撞碎了吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天要約會？\n對方的心臟應該撐不住吧。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日デート?\n相手の心臓が持つか心配です。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тому, кто встретит тебя, повезёт:\nведь ты — как билет в лотерею."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cita hoy? A la otra persona\nle va a dar un vuelco el corazón."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Date heute? Die Person gegenüber\nverliert gleich ihr Herz an dich, du Schönheit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.120" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신 만나는 사람,\n복 터졌네요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever gets to meet you\nhit the jackpot."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever meets you is\none lucky so-and-so."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能和你约会的人，\n祖坟冒青烟了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能跟你約會的人，\n是燒了幾輩子的好香啊？"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたに会える人は、\n一生分の運を使い切ってます。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Образ на пять баллов: ты\nможешь сразу на обложку."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quien quede contigo ha tocado\nel premio gordo. ¿Lo sabes, tú?"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer dich trifft, ist ein Glückspilz,\nwirklich wahr, du Traum."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.121" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "데이트 룩 완벽해요.\n화보 찍어도 되겠는데?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That date outfit is perfect.\nHonestly, you could be on a magazine cover!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Date outfit sorted, you\ncould do a magazine shoot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的约会造型满分，\n你直接拍封面吧？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "約會穿搭這麼完美，\n你直接拍寫真都可以欸！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デートコーデ完璧です。\nそのまま雑誌に載れます!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Одного взгляда хватит: ты\nвлюбишь в себя даже официанта."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu look es perfecto.\n¿Sesión de fotos o cita? Solo tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Date-Outfit sitzt perfekt.\nKönnte glatt aufs Cover, du Model!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.122" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘 당신 보면\n사랑에 빠질 것 같아요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Honestly, one look at you\nand anyone would fall in love."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeing you today,\nI might fall in love."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "见到今天的你，\n谁都会陷进去的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天看到你的人，\n大概都會墜入愛河。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日のあなたを見たら\n誰でも恋に落ちてしまいそう。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пока ты в пути, чьё-то\nсердце стучит всё громче."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con verte hoy, cualquiera\nse enamora un poquito, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute siehst du so gut aus,\nich verliebe mich fast, du Schöner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.123" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "데이트 전인데 벌써 예뻐요.\n상대방 심장 어쩔 거예요?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not even on the date yet and you look this good?\nThink of their poor heart!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not even on the date yet and\nyou look this good? Their poor heart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还没出门就这么美，\n对方的心脏该怎么办？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "約會還沒開始就這麼美，\n對方的小鹿要怎麼辦？"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デート前なのにもうかわいい。\n相手の心臓、どうなっちゃうの?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Верить в тебя — мой любимый\nспорт, а ты — главный чемпион."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La cita ni ha empezado y\nya le has robado el corazón."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noch vor dem Date so schön.\nWas wird da aus dem Herzen, du Schlingel?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.124" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신은 할 수 있어요!\n언제나 응원해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can do this!\nI am always cheering for you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go on, you can do it!\nWe are always cheering for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以的！\n我永远为你加油！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一定可以的！\n我永遠是你的後援會。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "できますよ、あなたなら!\nいつでも味方です!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Маленький шаг — тоже шаг, а ты\nв шагах — настоящий марафонец."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes con ello, tú.\nEstoy aquí para animarte siempre."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du schaffst das.\nIch bin immer auf deiner Seite, du Rakete!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.125" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "작은 발걸음도\n위대한 여정의 시작이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Even small steps from you\nare the start of something huge!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Small steps are the start of\na great journey, and you are on it!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再小的一步，\n也是壮阔旅程的开始！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再小的一步，\n也是偉大旅程的開始！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小さな一歩だって\n大きな旅のはじまりです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мечта близко: ведь ты\nидёшь к ней упорнее всех."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un pequeño paso es el inicio\nde un gran viaje, y lo das tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kleine Schritte sind der Anfang\neiner großen Reise, du Entdecker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.126" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "포기하지 마세요.\n당신의 꿈은 이루어질 거예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do not give up.\nWe know you will reach that dream!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don't give up, the dreams\nyou have will come true!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "别放弃，\n你的梦想会成真的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要放棄，\n你的夢想一定會實現！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あきらめないで。\nきっと夢はかないます!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сегодняшний труд — завтрашний\nуспех, а ты уже на трассе."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No te rindas: tus sueños\nse cumplirán, y tú ya lo sabes."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gib nicht auf.\nDein Traum wird wahr, wirst sehen, du Träumer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.127" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘의 노력이\n내일의 성공을 만들어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's effort from you is\nbuilding tomorrow's win!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's effort builds\nthe success you get tomorrow!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的努力，\n会长成明天的成功！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的努力，\n會變成明天的成就！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日の努力が\n明日の成功をつくります!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мир ещё не знает, что ты —\nтот, кто его изменит."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El esfuerzo de hoy es\nel éxito de mañana. Palabra."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Fleiß von heute baut\nden Erfolg von morgen, du Baumeister."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.128" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 열정이\n세상을 바꿀 거예요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The fire inside you\nis going to change the world!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That fire you have will\nchange the world!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "满腔热情的你，\n会改变世界！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "憑你的熱情，\n真的可以改變世界！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの情熱は、\nいつか世界を動かします!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Провалы — это черновик, а ты\nпишешь шедевр. Продолжай."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu pasión puede cambiar\nel mundo. Sigue así, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit deiner Leidenschaft\nänderst du noch die Welt, du Wirbelwind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.129" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "실패는 성공의 어머니!\n계속 도전해봐요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Failing is just practice for winning!\nKeep going, you!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Failure is just practice.\nKeep having a go, you!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失败是成功之母，\n接着冲就对了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失敗只是過程，\n你繼續衝就對了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失敗は成功のもと!\nどんどんチャレンジしよう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Потенциал безграничный: ты —\nпросто бесконечность в кроссовках."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fallar es parte del camino.\nInsiste, que tú puedes."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scheitern gehört dazu!\nEinfach weiter versuchen, du Kämpfer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.130" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 가능성은\n무한해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everyone agrees: you have\ncompletely unlimited potential!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There is no limit to what\nyou can be!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有你在，\n可能性就是无穷无尽的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能性這種東西，\n你根本是無限大！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの可能性は\nどこまでも広がっています!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Снова вперёд: ты —\nтот, кто делает невозможное."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu potencial no tiene techo.\nSin límites, como tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Möglichkeiten sind\nunbegrenzt, du Weltenbummler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.131" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘 하루도\n최선을 다해봐요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Give today\neverything you have!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Give today the lot, mate,\nyou know you can!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也\n全力以赴吧，你行的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天一樣，\n為你自己全力以赴吧！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日という日を\nせいいっぱい楽しもう!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Глядя, как ты стараешься,\nдругие тоже хотят действовать."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A darlo todo hoy,\nque tú sabes cómo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute wieder\nvoll loslegen, wie immer, du Rakete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.132" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신이 노력하는 모습,\n누군가에겐 동기부여예요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watching you try hard\nmotivates a lot of people, you know."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeing you work hard\nis motivation for someone else."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看到你努力的样子，\n别人也跟着有了动力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力的你，\n對別人來說就是動力。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力するあなたの姿が\n誰かのやる気スイッチになっています。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Всё получится, и это не\nутешение: ты просто неостановим."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verte esforzarte motiva\na más de uno, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wie du dich anstrengst,\nmotiviert andere, glaub mir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.133" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신이라면 다 잘될 거예요.\n진짜로요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything will work out for you.\nSeriously, I mean it!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It will all work out for you.\nCross my heart, it really will!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要是你，\n一切都会顺利的，真的！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有你出馬，\n一切都會順利的，真的啦！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大丈夫、あなたならうまくいく。\n本当にそう思ってるんです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Не сдавайся: с таким упорством\nты — готовый сценарий фильма."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo va a salir bien,\nporque lo harás tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit dir läuft am Ende alles gut.\nEhrlich, versprochen, du Glückskind!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.134" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "포기하지 말아요.\n당신은 충분히 멋진 사람이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do not quit. You are\nan amazing person and you know it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don't quit. Honestly,\nyou are a brilliant person."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "别放弃呀，\n你已经是很棒的人了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "千萬別放棄，\n你是很棒的人欸。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あきらめないでね。\nあなたはじゅうぶん素敵な人だから。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Поехали! Сегодня ты —\nглавный двигатель своей жизни."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No te rindas: ya eres\nuna gran persona, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gib nicht auf.\nEin toller Mensch ist keiner so wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.135" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "오늘도 화이팅!\n당신은 해낼 수 있어요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go get them today!\nSeriously, you have totally got this!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come on! Today,\nyou can absolutely smash it!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也加油！\n你一定做得到！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天也要加油喔！\n你一定做得到！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日もがんばろう!\nあなたならやれるよ!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Те, кто видят твои усилия, за\nтебя. Знай: ты — не один."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Ánimo! Tienes lo que hay\nque tener, y de sobra, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los geht's, auf ein Neues!\nDas packt keiner so wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.136" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신의 노력을 아는 사람은\n당신을 응원할 거예요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anyone who sees how hard you work\nwill be rooting for you."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "People who see how hard you work\nwill always cheer you on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "知道你有多努力的人，\n都会站在你这边。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "懂得你努力的人，\n一定會支持你到底。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "努力を知っている人は、\nきっとあなたを応援してくれます。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ценность не измеряется\nлайками, а ты — бесценный."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quien conoce tu esfuerzo\nte aplaude. Y yo también, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer deine Mühe sieht,\nfeuert dich garantiert an, du Kämpfer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.137" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "당신은 충분히\n가치 있는 사람이에요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Say it with me: you are more than enough\nand worth every bit of hype!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enough? Well, you are more than\nenough, and worth every bit!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毫无疑问，\n你本身就很有价值！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聽好，\n你本來就是很有價值的人喔！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "それだけで\nあなたは価値のある人なんです!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Как есть — так и идеально:\nты — готовый шедевр."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vales muchísimo,\ncon todas las letras, tú."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wertvoll ist man auch genau jetzt,\nso wie du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "quote.138" : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "있는 그대로의 당신,\n그게 완벽해요!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just as you are,\nyou are perfect!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just as you are,\nthat is already perfect!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本来的你，\n就已经完美了！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原本的你，\n就已經很完美了！"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ありのままのあなたが、\nもう完成形ですよ!"
